$ key.up ShiftLeft
ShiftLeft up
$ mouse.move 320,180
cursor 320,180
$ mouse.click left 320,180
left click for 1 frame
$ mouse.drag left 100,100 300,200 4 4
left drag 100,100 to 300,200 in 4 steps over 4 frames
