scroll 0,2
$ mouse.release
cursor released
$ action.press actions.Forward 2
Forward down for 2 frames
$ action.down actions.Fire
Fire down
$ action.up actions.Fire
Fire up
$ action.list
actions.Forward	W	Move forward
actions.Fire	MouseLeft	Fire at the cursor

